The code in this directory is derived from two sources, whose notices
follow.

fdlibm.go is a port of V8's src/base/ieee754.cc (V8 14.6), which V8 adapted
from fdlibm.

pow.go and powdata.go are a port of the double-precision pow in Arm's
Optimized Routines (https://github.com/ARM-software/optimized-routines,
math/pow.c, math/pow_log_data.c and math/exp_data.c), used here under its
MIT license.

